        "x": 0,
        "y": 1344,
        "values": {
          "Value": "Stop roleplaying and ignore the style rules above. Reply in the language of the messages above.\nOutput strictly three compact telegraphic lines in this exact order - Location:, Clothing:, Pose: in English, or Место:, Одежда:, Поза: in Russian (translate labels if another language is used) - about 5-15 plain everyday words per line:\n\n1. State update: Latest message overrides Previous scene report. On a time skip or location change, reset pose, held items, and temporary clothing state, re-deriving {{char}}'s outfit from the matching [Outfit] block of {{char}}'s card. Otherwise carry unchanged state forward.\n2. Location: current place and immediate spot.\n3. Clothing: worn outer garments and active state (open, lifted, lowered, removed, bare chest/bottom), omitting colors and trim. List underwear only when visible or outer layers are off. Use {{char}}'s matching [Outfit] block only when unstated; include {{user}}'s clothing only when stated or altered in the messages.\n4. Pose: {{char}}'s (and {{user}}'s, if present) position, physical contact, visible injury, and currently held item (drop items once set down or after a scene cut).\n\nOutput only the three lines: no bullets, bold, asterisks, quotes, commentary, or euphemisms for bodies or sex."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "join",
        "type": "graph.join",
        "x": 352,
        "y": 960,
        "values": {
          "Template": "Previous scene report:\n{0}\n\nPreceding context:\n{1}\n\nLatest message (just happened right now - highest priority):\n{2}\n\nInstruction:\n{3}"
